  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Takes a raw qPCR RDML export through a blinded, staged review: confirm the design, then the curve calls, then decide the analysis choices that change conclusions (with reasons), then send an audited, Prism-ready bundle and read back edits made in Prism. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
